            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "One of the major goals of the JUnit Platform architecture is to improve maintainers' capabilities to evolve JUnit despite its being used in many projects. With JUnit 4 a lot of stuff that was originally added as an internal construct only got used by external extension writers and tool builders. That made changing JUnit 4 especially difficult and sometimes impossible."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "That’s why JUnit now uses a defined lifecycle for all publicly available interfaces, classes, and methods."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Every published artifact has a version number "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "<major>.<minor>.<patch>"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", and all publicly available interfaces, classes, and methods are annotated with "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "@API"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://apiguardian-team.github.io/apiguardian/docs/current/api/"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " from the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "@API Guardian"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/apiguardian-team/apiguardian"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " project. The annotation’s "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "status"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute can be assigned one of the following values."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "autowidth": false,
            "body": [
              [
